4. Gamification: Ranks, Medals & Cash Rewards
Every completed bus trip, bike ride, or parcel delivery increments completed_trips. Milestones automatically award a Rank Title, a 3D Metallic SVG Medal, and an Instant Cash Prize credited directly to the user's DE RIDE Wallet.
