5. Amebo AI Engine (Python FastAPI + Groq API)
Amebo AI (ai/ microservice hosted on Render) is DE RIDE's culturally fluent Nigerian travel companion, traffic gist reporter, Pidgin/Yoruba/Hausa/Igbo storyteller, trivia host, and driver fatigue-alert buddy powered by Groq LPU Inference (llama-3.3-70b-versatile & whisper-large-v3 for voice).
Token Economy & Expiration Mechanics
 * Daily Free Grant: Every active user receives 10 Free Daily Tokens at 00:00 WAT.
   * Strict Expiration Rule: Unused daily free tokens expire at 23:59:59 WAT every day (enforced by Go's token_reset_worker.go and query-time timestamp checks; they do not roll over).
 * Consumption Rate:
   * 1 Text Prompt / Story / Traffic Gist = 1 Token
   * 1 Voice-to-Voice Pidgin Banter / Trivia Round = 2 Tokens
 * Purchasable Token Packs (Non-Expiring Rollover):
   * Once the 10 daily free tokens are exhausted or expired, users can buy rollover token bundles via Paystack or DE RIDE Wallet:
     * Starter Gist Pack: 23 Tokens — ₦4,200
     * Long-Bridge Pack: 50 Tokens — ₦6,700
     * Expressway Pack: 75 Tokens — ₦8,000
     * Oga Boss Pack: 100 Tokens — ₦10,200
   * Deduction Order: Go backend always deducts from daily_free_tokens first (when now() < daily_tokens_expires_at) before deducting from purchased_tokens.
6. Complete Tech & Design Stack (Zero External Cache Cost Under 5,000 Users)
 * Design & Prototyping: Figma (Dark/High-Contrast tokens), LottieFiles (micro-animations for QR scan success & radar pulses), Lucide Icons + Custom SVG Nigerian Transit & Telco Icon Set.
 * Frontend PWA (frontend/ on Vercel): Next.js 15 (App Router, TypeScript), Tailwind CSS, active Biker/Dispatch mode, IndexedDB offline scan queue and RSA public-key cache, MapLibre GL with OpenFreeMap dark tiles, QR camera scanner.
 * Backend API & Real-Time Engine (backend/ on Render): Go 1.23+ (Fiber v2), gorilla/websocket / gofiber/contrib/websocket (goroutine rooms for GPS, chat & SOS), pgx/v5 (Neon Postgres driver), and an In-App Memory CacheStore (sync.RWMutex + TTL janitor) + Go ticker workers (zero external Redis/BullMQ cost until 5,000+ users; interface-ready for Redis drop-in later).
 * AI Microservice (ai/ on Render): Python 3.12+ (FastAPI + Uvicorn) + groq async Python SDK (llama-3.3-70b-versatile & whisper-large-v3).
 * Database & Spatial (database/ on Neon): Neon Serverless PostgreSQL 16 with PostGIS extension (nationwide 36-state + FCT park geofencing & radius queries).
 * Maps & Telemetry: Google Maps Platform (Maps JavaScript API, Directions API, Distance Matrix API, Places Autocomplete, Geocoding API).
 * Media & Document Automation: Cloudinary SDK (signed upload presets, face-crop transforms c_thumb,g_face, OCR/moderation webhook for driver/biker/dispatch credentials).
 * Email & OTP Delivery: Go net/smtp TLS / Nodemailer-compatible SMTP via Gmail (elversetechnologies@gmail.com authenticated with Google App Password).
 * Payments & VTU Data: Paystack API (Initialize Transaction, Webhook HMAC SHA-512 verification, Transfers API for bank refunds/payouts) + Configurable VTU Provider API (VTU_BASE_URL / VTU_API_KEY).
7. Complete Database Schema (Neon PostgreSQL + PostGIS)
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS "pgcrypto";
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS "postgis";

-- 1. USERS, DUAL RIDER MODES & GAMIFICATION
CREATE TABLE users (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    full_name VARCHAR(120) NOT NULL,
    email VARCHAR(150) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    phone_number VARCHAR(20) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    password_hash TEXT NOT NULL,
    role VARCHAR(25) NOT NULL CHECK (role IN ('passenger', 'driver', 'dispatcher', 'operator', 'biker', 'dispatch_rider', 'admin')),
    active_rider_mode VARCHAR(25) CHECK (active_rider_mode IN ('biker', 'dispatch_rider')),
    is_biker_verified BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    is_dispatch_verified BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    language_pref VARCHAR(5) DEFAULT 'en' CHECK (language_pref IN ('en', 'yo', 'ha', 'ig', 'pcm')),
    profile_photo_url TEXT,
    cloudinary_public_id TEXT,
    is_email_verified BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    kyc_status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'UNVERIFIED' CHECK (kyc_status IN ('UNVERIFIED', 'PENDING', 'VERIFIED', 'REJECTED')),
    gps_opt_in BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    wallet_balance NUMERIC(12, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,
    completed_trips INT DEFAULT 0,
    current_rank VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'Street Scout',
    current_medal VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'Bronze Compass',
    daily_free_tokens INT DEFAULT 10,
    daily_tokens_expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    purchased_tokens INT DEFAULT 0,
    active_subscription_tier VARCHAR(30) DEFAULT 'FREE',
    subscription_expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 2. EMAIL OTP VERIFICATION (elversetechnologies@gmail.com)
CREATE TABLE email_otps (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    email VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
    otp_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    purpose VARCHAR(30) CHECK (purpose IN ('REGISTRATION', 'PASSWORD_RESET', 'WITHDRAWAL')),
    expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    attempts INT DEFAULT 0,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 3. VEHICLE, BIKE & DISPATCH CREDENTIALS (Cloudinary Automated Pipeline)
CREATE TABLE vehicle_credentials (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    owner_id UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    vehicle_type VARCHAR(25) CHECK (vehicle_type IN ('BUS_14_SEATER', 'BUS_18_SEATER', 'COASTER', 'SIENNA', 'BIKE', 'DISPATCH_BIKE')),
    plate_number VARCHAR(20) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    seat_capacity INT NOT NULL,
    drivers_license_url TEXT NOT NULL,
    vehicle_license_url TEXT NOT NULL,
    road_worthiness_url TEXT NOT NULL,
    dispatch_box_photo_url TEXT, -- Required when unlocking Dispatch Rider mode
    dispatch_permit_url TEXT,    -- Required when unlocking Dispatch Rider mode
    cloudinary_asset_ids JSONB NOT NULL,
    hardware_gps_imei VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE,
    verification_status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'PENDING' CHECK (verification_status IN ('PENDING', 'APPROVED', 'REJECTED')),
    rejection_reason TEXT,
    verified_by UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 4. NATIONWIDE STATIONARY BUS PARKS (All 36 States + FCT; Ogun & Lagos Launch Hubs)
CREATE TABLE bus_parks (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    park_name VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
    address TEXT NOT NULL,
    lga VARCHAR(80) NOT NULL,
    state VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    state_code VARCHAR(5) NOT NULL, -- e.g., 'LA', 'OG', 'FC', 'RV', 'KN'
    is_launch_priority BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE, -- TRUE for Ogun & Lagos hub parks
    is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT TRUE,
    geofence GEOGRAPHY(POLYGON, 4326),
    center_point GEOGRAPHY(POINT, 4326) NOT NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 5. TRIPS & 120-SECOND LOCK TRACKING
CREATE TABLE trips (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    vehicle_id UUID REFERENCES vehicle_credentials(id),
    driver_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    dispatcher_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    origin_park_id UUID REFERENCES bus_parks(id),
    destination_park_id UUID REFERENCES bus_parks(id),
    destination_label VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL,
    route_polyline TEXT,
    base_fare NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    total_seats INT NOT NULL,
    booked_seats INT DEFAULT 0,
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'BOARDING' CHECK (status IN ('BOARDING', 'DEPARTED', 'IN_TRANSIT', 'ARRIVED', 'CANCELLED')),
    gps_source VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'MANUAL' CHECK (gps_source IN ('MANUAL', 'DRIVER_APP', 'DISPATCHER_APP', 'HARDWARE')),
    current_location GEOGRAPHY(POINT, 4326),
    scheduled_departure_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    actual_departed_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    arrived_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    last_capacity_update_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT '1970-01-01 00:00:00+00', -- Enforces 120s lock
    last_updated_by UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 6. TICKETS, OFFLINE QR & MANUAL CODES
CREATE TABLE tickets (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    trip_id UUID REFERENCES trips(id),
    passenger_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    seat_number INT NOT NULL,
    manual_ticket_code VARCHAR(15) UNIQUE NOT NULL, -- e.g., DR-LA-8492-X7
   qr_signed_payload TEXT NOT NULL, -- RSA-2048 PKCS#1 v1.5 / SHA-256 signed JSON envelope
    base_fare NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    platform_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 20.00,
    paystack_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    total_paid NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    paystack_reference VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    status VARCHAR(25) DEFAULT 'VALID' CHECK (status IN ('VALID', 'BOARDED', 'CANCELLED_100', 'LATE_ARRIVAL_80', 'NO_SHOW_40')),
    refund_amount NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,
    refund_destination VARCHAR(20) CHECK (refund_destination IN ('WALLET', 'BANK_ACCOUNT')),
    scanned_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    scanned_offline BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    UNIQUE(trip_id, seat_number)
);

-- 7. BIKER & DISPATCH RIDER ORDERS
CREATE TABLE rider_orders (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    order_type VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL CHECK (order_type IN ('BIKE_PASSENGER', 'PARCEL_DISPATCH')),
    customer_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    rider_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    pickup_address TEXT NOT NULL,
    pickup_point GEOGRAPHY(POINT, 4326) NOT NULL,
    dropoff_address TEXT NOT NULL,
    dropoff_point GEOGRAPHY(POINT, 4326) NOT NULL,
    parcel_description TEXT,
    receiver_phone VARCHAR(20),
    delivery_otp VARCHAR(6),
    base_fare NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    platform_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 20.00,
    paystack_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    total_paid NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    status VARCHAR(25) DEFAULT 'SEARCHING' CHECK (status IN ('SEARCHING', 'ACCEPTED', 'IN_PROGRESS', 'COMPLETED', 'CANCELLED_100', 'LATE_80', 'NO_SHOW_40')),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 8. EPHEMERAL MESSAGES (6-Minute Auto-Purge)
CREATE TABLE messages (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    trip_id UUID REFERENCES trips(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    rider_order_id UUID REFERENCES rider_orders(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
    sender_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    sender_role VARCHAR(25) NOT NULL,
    content TEXT NOT NULL,
    is_flagged BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 9. REAL-TIME ESCALATIONS & ADMIN DISPUTES
CREATE TABLE escalations (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    trip_id UUID REFERENCES trips(id),
    rider_order_id UUID REFERENCES rider_orders(id),
    reporter_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    accused_user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    assigned_admin_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    category VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    description TEXT NOT NULL,
    gps_snapshot GEOGRAPHY(POINT, 4326),
    preserved_chat_log JSONB,
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'OPEN_URGENT' CHECK (status IN ('OPEN_URGENT', 'ADMIN_JOINED', 'RESOLVED')),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

-- 10. SUBSCRIPTIONS, LEDGER, AMEBO AI & VTU DATA ORDERS
CREATE TABLE transactions (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    tx_type VARCHAR(35) CHECK (tx_type IN ('TICKET_PURCHASE', 'RIDER_ORDER', 'REFUND', 'SUBSCRIPTION', 'PER_BUS_FEE', 'AMEBO_TOKENS', 'VTU_DATA', 'RANK_CASH_PRIZE', 'CASHBACK', 'WITHDRAWAL')),
    amount NUMERIC(12, 2) NOT NULL,
    paystack_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,
    platform_fee NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,
    reference VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    metadata JSONB,
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'SUCCESS',
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE TABLE vtu_data_orders (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    user_id UUID REFERENCES users(id),
    network VARCHAR(15) NOT NULL CHECK (network IN ('MTN', 'AIRTEL', 'GLO', '9MOBILE')),
    plan_code VARCHAR(60) NOT NULL,
    plan_label VARCHAR(120) NOT NULL,
    beneficiary_phone VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
    amount_paid NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,
    vtu_provider_ref VARCHAR(120),
    status VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'PENDING' CHECK (status IN ('PENDING', 'DELIVERED', 'FAILED_REFUNDED')),
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

8. Offline & Online QR + Manual Ticket Code Specification
Motor parks across Nigeria frequently experience cellular dead zones. Tickets verify in <150ms completely offline.
 * Manual Ticket Code Format: DR-{STATE_CODE}-{4_DIGITS}-{2_ALPHANUM_CHECKSUM}
   * Example: DR-OG-4918-K3 (Ogun State) or DR-LA-7302-M9 (Lagos State).
   * Checksum Logic: Last 2 characters are Base32-encoded Mod-97 checksum of (trip_id + seat_number + passenger_id_prefix) so a Driver/Dispatcher can verify structural validity without internet.
 * Cryptographic QR Payload:
   * When Paystack or Wallet confirms payment, the Go backend signs a compact JSON payload using RS256 (RSA-2048 private key):
     {
  "tid": "9f8c2a1b",
  "tkt": "DR-LA-7302-M9",
  "seat": 4,
  "pax": "Chinedu O.",
  "exp": 1795003200
}

   * Offline Verification Flow: The Driver/Dispatcher PWA caches the DE RIDE RS256 Public Key in IndexedDB. When scanning a passenger's QR code offline, the app verifies the cryptographic signature locally via WebCrypto API, queues the scan in IndexedDB, and syncs while the scanner PWA is open when connectivity returns.
