   * Ephemeral messaging banner with live 05:59 post-arrival self-destruct countdown and red 🚨 Escalate to DE RIDE Admin button bridging User <-> DE RIDE Admin <-> Driver / Dispatcher / Biker / Dispatch Rider in real time.
 * Driver, Dispatcher & Park Operator Console (/driver/dashboard & /park-operator/terminal):
   * +1 / -1 Seat & Departure Time controls protected by the 120-Second Cooldown Ring, GPS source selector, online/offline QR scanner + manual code keypad, and fleet billing (₦250/bus or ₦5,000/mo or ₦15,000/mo — hiding ₦60,000 Passenger Lifetime plan).
 * Biker & Dispatch Rider Dual Portals (/biker/radar & /dispatch-rider/deliveries):
