| POST | /api/v1/auth/register | Public | { full_name, email, phone_number, password, role, language_pref, gps_opt_in } — Sends 6-digit OTP via elversetechnologies@gmail.com. |
| POST | /api/v1/auth/verify-otp | Public | { email, otp, purpose } — Returns access_token + refresh_token. |
| POST | /api/v1/users/switch-rider-mode | Biker / Dispatch | { target_mode: 'biker' | 'dispatch_rider' } — Verifies dual KYC & zero active orders; returns updated JWT. |
| POST | /api/v1/media/cloudinary-sign | Bearer | { folder_type: 'PROFILE' | 'VEHICLE_DOC' | 'DISPATCH_DOC' } — Generates signed Cloudinary upload params. |
