|---|---|---|---|
| GET | /api/v1/parks | Bearer | Query: ?state=Lagos&lat=6.6018&lng=3.3515 — Returns active parks nationwide (Ogun & Lagos prioritized). |
| PATCH | /api/v1/trips/:tripId/capacity-departure | Driver / Dispatcher / Operator | { booked_seats?, scheduled_departure_at? } — Enforces 120-second in-memory cooldown. Returns 429 with retry_after_seconds if locked. |
| POST | /api/v1/trips/:tripId/depart | Driver / Operator | Marks bus DEPARTED, deducts ₦250 if on Per-Bus plan, starts 10-min late-arrival grace timer. |
