|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/v1/tickets/checkout | Passenger | { trip_id, seat_number, payment_method: 'PAYSTACK' | 'WALLET' } — Computes Base + ₦20 + Paystack Fee. |
| POST | /api/v1/tickets/scan | Driver / Dispatcher | { qr_payload?, manual_code?, scanned_at, offline_sync: boolean } — Validates RS256 signature and marks BOARDED. |
| POST | /api/v1/tickets/:ticketId/refund | Passenger | { claim_type: 'CANCEL' | 'LATE_ARRIVAL' | 'NO_SHOW', destination: 'WALLET' | 'BANK_ACCOUNT', bank_details? } — Computes 100% / 80% / 40% of Base Fare only. |
| GET | /api/v1/data/plans | Bearer | Query: ?network=MTN — Returns cached affordable data bundles from VTU_BASE_URL. |
| POST | /api/v1/data/purchase | Bearer | { network, plan_code, beneficiary_phone, payment_method } — Vends mobile data via VTU_BASE_URL + VTU_API_KEY. |
