| gps:telemetry_push | Client/Hardware \rightarrow Server | { trip_id, lat, lng, speed, source } — Requires gps_opt_in = true; enforces HARDWARE > DRIVER_APP > DISPATCHER_APP priority. |
| chat:send_message | Client \rightarrow Server | { trip_id, content } — Broadcasts to room; blocked if now() > arrived_at + 6 mins. |
| escalation:create | Client \rightarrow Server | { trip_id?, rider_order_id?, category, description, lat, lng } — Immediately alerts live DE RIDE Admin & opens 3-way mediation room. |
11. Standardized Error Code Registry
| HTTP Status | Error Code | Trigger Condition & User-Facing Resolution |
|---|---|---|
| 402 | ERR_AMEBO_INSUFFICIENT_TOKENS | Daily 10 free tokens have been used/expired and purchased_tokens == 0. Prompts token pack purchase. |
| 403 | ERR_ROLE_PLAN_RESTRICTED | Driver, Dispatcher, Biker, Dispatch Rider, or Park Operator attempts to purchase the ₦60,000 One-Time Lifetime Plan. |
| 403 | ERR_DISPATCH_KYC_INCOMPLETE | Biker attempts to switch to Dispatch Rider mode without verified dispatch box/permit credentials. |
| 403 | ERR_GPS_OPT_IN_REQUIRED | Client attempts to stream GPS coordinates without gps_opt_in = true. |
| 409 | ERR_SEAT_ALREADY_LOCKED | Another passenger locked or purchased the requested seat_number milliseconds earlier. |
| 409 | ERR_ACTIVE_ORDER_MODE_LOCK | Biker/Dispatch Rider attempts to switch modes while an active ride or delivery is in progress. |
| 410 | ERR_CHAT_WINDOW_EXPIRED | Attempt to send or fetch chat messages more than 6 minutes after the trip ended. |
| 422 | ERR_REFUND_WINDOW_INVALID | Passenger requests a LATE_ARRIVAL (80%) refund before the 10-minute post-departure threshold has elapsed. |
| 429 | ERR_CAPACITY_COOLDOWN_ACTIVE | Operator/Driver/Dispatcher attempts to edit bus seats or departure time before the 120-second lock expires. |
12. Production Security & Compliance Checklist
 * [ ] Cryptographic Payment Verification: Verify x-paystack-signature using HMAC SHA-512 on raw request bytes in Go before fulfilling tickets, subscriptions, VTU data orders, or Amebo token packs; enforce idempotency on paystack_reference.
 * [ ] Offline QR Key Rotation: Store the RSA private signing key exclusively in Render environment secrets; expose only the public verification key via /api/v1/keys/public with a key ID for rotation.
 * [ ] Go \leftrightarrow Python Internal Service Auth: Protect all /ai/v1/* endpoints on Render with an X-Internal-Secret HMAC/shared-secret middleware so external clients cannot bypass Go's token meter.
 * [ ] Cloudinary Signed Uploads & MIME Enforcement: Disable unsigned uploads in Cloudinary; restrict upload presets strictly to image/jpeg, image/png, image/webp, and application/pdf with a 5MB max file size.
 * [ ] SMTP & OTP Brute-Force Guard: Rate-limit /auth/verify-otp to max 5 attempts per OTP and 3 OTP requests per email per hour via in-memory TTL counters; store only bcrypt-hashed OTPs.
 * [ ] 6-Minute Data Retention Worker: Run Go's chat_purge_worker.go ticker every 30 seconds to hard-delete expired messages (arrived_at + 6 minutes) unless locked by an active escalations record.
 * [ ] PII Anonymization in Co-Passenger Manifest: Mask full surnames and phone numbers on public seat maps (displaying only First Name + Last Initial + Rank Medal) while granting full emergency manifest access exclusively to verified DE RIDE Admins during active escalations.
